    "directions": [
      "In a bowl add chicken, salt, degi red chilli powder, maida, corn-starch, egg whites and mix everything properly.",
      "Now fry this in medium hot oil until golden brown and crispy. Remove on absorbent paper and keep aside for further use.",
      "In a pan add oil, ginger, garlic, green chillies, star anise and saute for a minute.",
      "Now add onion, red bell pepper, green bell pepper saute for 1-2 minutes and add thick soya sauce, brown sugar, pineapple, chilli sauce, mix everything properly add some water, corn-starch slurry mix and bring it to a boil.",
      "Now add vinegar, fried chicken and toss it properly cook for a minute.",
      "Switch off the flames, serve it in a plate and garnish with coriander leaves."
    ],
